Meta.documentation:String.concatenate
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Glues Strings together into one.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Accumulates every String received between begin and end and emits the
Meta.documentation:concatenation — the standard way to turn a List of Strings into one String.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port in_String_default_$all — next piece of text to append
Meta.documentation:@port out_String_default — the glued String, emitted at end of input
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@example
Meta.documentation:[String:Hello String:%20 String:World]>>String.concatenate:>>Console:
Meta.documentation:---
Meta.documentation:Hello World
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@see String.upper List.join
Meta.documentation:@kind operator
Meta.documentation:@status stable
Meta.documentation:

